# "Enchanted creature ... has ward {2}": Bot2's Lightning Bolt at the enchanted Ornithopter triggers the ward; Bot2 has two
# more mana (Mox Jet and Mox Emerald) but does not pay, so the Bolt is countered and the Ornithopter lives. The second Bolt,
# with the {2} paid, is not countered and kills it - and the Aura going with it gives Bot2's exiled Mox Ruby back.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Sheltered by Ghosts
Plains x3
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mountain
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sheltered by Ghosts.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#1.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Decline
Bot2.Pass
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Damage = 0
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain#2.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.PayCost
[T6 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Sheltered by Ghosts; Ornithopter
Bot2.Battlefield = Mountain; Mountain; Mox Jet; Mox Emerald; Mox Ruby
